---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="AI 숨은 돈 진단 — 30초 입력 → 우선순위 + 예상 금액" description="직장·계좌·보험·통신·카드 등 30초 입력 → Gemini가 13개 카테고리 발견 우선순위 + 예상 금액 + 즉시 조회 사이트 자동.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pt-16 pb-8">
    <a href="/hidden-money/" class="text-sm text-zinc-500 hover:text-emerald-300 transition">← 숨은 돈 13개</a>
    <div class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/40 bg-emerald-500/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs">
      <span class="inline-block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
      <span class="font-bold text-emerald-300">AI 진단 — 30초</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black leading-tight"><span class="text-gradient">내 숨은 돈</span> 진단</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-zinc-400">13개 카테고리 우선순위 + 예상 금액.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-6">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-6 space-y-3">
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <label class="block"><span class="block text-xs font-bold text-zinc-300 mb-1.5">나이 *</span><input id="age" type="number" value="35" class="w-full rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none px-4 py-2.5 text-white tabular-nums" /></label>
        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-6"><input id="inheritance" type="checkbox" class="w-4 h-4 accent-emerald-500" /><span class="text-sm text-zinc-300">상속·증여 받은 경험</span></label>
      </div>
      <label class="block"><span class="block text-xs font-bold text-zinc-300 mb-1.5">직장 이력 (이직·퇴직 횟수, 회사 종류)</span><textarea id="jobHistory" rows="2" placeholder="예: 3번 이직, 그 중 1곳 폐업. 현재 직장 5년차" class="w-full rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-zinc-200"></textarea></label>
      <label class="block"><span class="block text-xs font-bold text-zinc-300 mb-1.5">은행 계좌 (대략 개수·활성 비율)</span><input id="bankAccounts" type="text" placeholder="예: 5개 (활성 2, 비활성 3)" class="w-full rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none px-4 py-2.5 text-white" /></label>
      <label class="block"><span class="block text-xs font-bold text-zinc-300 mb-1.5">가입한 보험 (개수·기간)</span><input id="insurance" type="text" placeholder="예: 실손 1, 종신 1, 자녀 보험 2 (20년+)" class="w-full rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none px-4 py-2.5 text-white" /></label>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <label class="block"><span class="block text-xs font-bold text-zinc-300 mb-1.5">부동산 거래 (5년 내)</span><input id="realEstate" type="text" placeholder="예: 전세 1회, 매매 X" class="w-full rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none px-4 py-2.5 text-white" /></label>
        <label class="block"><span class="block text-xs font-bold text-zinc-300 mb-1.5">자동차 (매매·이전)</span><input id="cars" type="text" placeholder="예: 2년 전 매도" class="w-full rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none px-4 py-2.5 text-white" /></label>
      </div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <label class="block"><span class="block text-xs font-bold text-zinc-300 mb-1.5">통신사 변경 (3년 내)</span><input id="telecomChanges" type="text" placeholder="예: SKT → KT 1회" class="w-full rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none px-4 py-2.5 text-white" /></label>
        <label class="block"><span class="block text-xs font-bold text-zinc-300 mb-1.5">카드 (개수)</span><input id="cards" type="text" placeholder="예: 4장 (3개 카드사)" class="w-full rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none px-4 py-2.5 text-white" /></label>
      </div>
      <label class="block"><span class="block text-xs font-bold text-zinc-300 mb-1.5">복지 자격 가능성 (있다면)</span><input id="welfare" type="text" placeholder="예: 만 65세, 장애, 다자녀, 저소득 등" class="w-full rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none px-4 py-2.5 text-white" /></label>
      <textarea id="extra" rows="2" placeholder="추가 정보 (예: 항공 마일리지 적립 카드 5년+, 군 복무, 해외 거주)" class="w-full rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 focus:border-emerald-500 outline-none px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-zinc-200"></textarea>
      <button id="go" type="button" class="w-full rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-white font-black py-3 disabled:opacity-50 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20">💰 AI 진단 시작</button>
      <p id="status" class="text-xs text-zinc-400 text-center"></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="result" class="hidden mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-2 space-y-3">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border-2 border-emerald-500/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/15 to-cyan-500/5 p-8">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-300 uppercase tracking-widest">예상 발견 가능 총액</p>
      <p id="total" class="mt-2 text-6xl sm:text-7xl font-black text-white tabular-nums">-</p>
      <div class="mt-3 flex gap-3 text-sm">
        <span>신뢰도: <span id="confidence" class="font-black">-</span></span>
        <span>예상 소요: <span id="totalTime" class="font-black">-</span></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/5 p-5">
      <h4 class="text-xs font-black text-amber-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">⚡ 즉시 5분 작업</h4>
      <ul id="quickWins" class="space-y-1 text-sm text-zinc-300 list-disc list-inside"></ul>
    </div>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-emerald-300">우선순위 (큰 금액부터)</h3>
    <div id="priority" class="space-y-3"></div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-500/40 bg-cyan-500/5 p-5">
      <h4 class="text-xs font-black text-cyan-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">📅 시간 들여서 할 것</h4>
      <ul id="longTerm" class="space-y-1 text-sm text-zinc-300 list-disc list-inside"></ul>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-rose-500/40 bg-rose-500/5 p-5">
      <h4 class="text-xs font-black text-rose-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">⚠ 시효·함정 주의</h4>
      <ul id="warnings" class="space-y-1 text-sm text-zinc-300 list-disc list-inside"></ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script is:inline>
  const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
  const esc = (s) => String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g, (c) => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
  const fmt = (n) => '₩' + (+(n || '0').toString().replace(/[^\d]/g,'')).toLocaleString('ko-KR');

  $('go').addEventListener('click', async () => {
    if (!+$('age').value) { $('status').textContent = '⚠ 나이 필수'; $('status').className = 'text-xs text-rose-300 text-center'; return; }
    $('go').disabled = true;
    $('status').textContent = '🤖 13개 카테고리 진단 중... (10초)';
    $('status').className = 'text-xs text-emerald-300 text-center animate-pulse';

    const body = {};
    ['age','jobHistory','bankAccounts','insurance','realEstate','cars','telecomChanges','cards','welfare','extra'].forEach((id) => { body[id] = $(id).value; });
    body.inheritance = $('inheritance').checked;

    try {
      const res = await fetch('/api/ai-hidden-money', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(body) });
      const data = await res.json();
      if (!data.ok) {
        $('status').textContent = '❌ ' + (data.error || '진단 실패');
        $('status').className = 'text-xs text-rose-300 text-center';
        $('go').disabled = false; return;
      }
      $('result').classList.remove('hidden');
      $('status').textContent = '✓ 진단 완료';
      $('status').className = 'text-xs text-emerald-300 text-center';

      $('total').textContent = fmt(data.totalEstimate);
      $('confidence').textContent = data.confidence || '-';
      $('totalTime').textContent = data.estimatedTotalTime || '-';
      $('quickWins').innerHTML = (data.quickWins || []).map((x) => `<li>${esc(x)}</li>`).join('');
      $('longTerm').innerHTML = (data.longTermActions || []).map((x) => `<li>${esc(x)}</li>`).join('');
      $('warnings').innerHTML = (data.warnings || []).map((x) => `<li>${esc(x)}</li>`).join('');

      $('priority').innerHTML = (data.priority || []).map((p, i) => `<div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-5">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-2">
          <div><span class="text-[10px] font-black px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500 text-white">#${i+1}</span><h4 class="inline ml-2 font-black text-lg text-white">${esc(p.category || '')}</h4></div>
          <span class="text-xl font-black text-emerald-300 tabular-nums">${fmt(p.estimatedAmount)}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2"><span class="text-xs text-zinc-400">발견 확률:</span><div class="flex-1 bg-zinc-900 rounded-full h-2"><div class="bg-emerald-500 h-2 rounded-full" style="width: ${p.probability || 0}%"></div></div><span class="text-xs font-bold tabular-nums">${p.probability || 0}%</span></div>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-300 mb-3">${esc(p.whyYou || '')}</p>
        <a href="${esc(p.officialUrl || '#')}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="block rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 p-3 mb-3 hover:bg-emerald-500/20 transition">
          <p class="text-[10px] font-black text-emerald-300 uppercase">공식 조회 (${esc(p.timeToFind || '')})</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-cyan-300 mt-1">${esc(p.officialName || '')} ↗</p>
        </a>
        <ol class="space-y-1 text-sm text-zinc-300 list-decimal list-inside">${(p.actionSteps || []).map((s) => `<li>${esc(s)}</li>`).join('')}</ol>
      </div>`).join('');

      if (window.va) { try { window.va('event', { name: 'hidden_money_diagnose', data: { total: data.totalEstimate } }); } catch (_) {} }
    } catch (e) {
      $('status').textContent = '❌ ' + e.message;
      $('status').className = 'text-xs text-rose-300 text-center';
    } finally {
      $('go').disabled = false;
    }
  });
</script>
